+// CPT (b1778, Rule Checker A03 on v675): capture bookkeeping bugs. Runtime data flag CPT_TAB[1], read first; 0 = off.
+// 1: spawn_purchases runs before the capture stage, so on a capture-recall's arrival turn the reward's gold is spent before the payout
+//    test sees it; the test compares max(gold, gold before this turn's purchases), and a gain read while the group state is unknown (0)
+//    counts only after a recall started since the timer, else it rebases. 2: a body joining an ally's running capture takes the engine's
+//    remaining timer (cs.timer) as the pay round, min'd with its own estimate, in capture_recall and capture_wait_lethal. 4: track_progress
+//    resets best_d when its value turns from Chebyshev to a path value (a fuel-short first call left a Chebyshev best that path values never
+//    beat, and drop_target(60) fired mid-walk). 8: capture_recall's gold share uses split_share (GR:207). 16: the low-fuel exit count
+//    resets on a turn that moved or captures.
+#define CPT_BITS 0
+inline const volatile int CPT_TAB[2] = { 0x43505431, CPT_BITS }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+#define CPT_ON(b) ((CPT_TAB[1] & (b)) != 0)
 
